<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 3.0030.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 3.0030.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0030 against the dollar, up from 3.0130 on Monday, and at 1.8280 against the mark, up from 1.8295, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty at an average of 2.54 percent from the central weighted dollar and mark parity rates, stronger than from Monday's 2.40 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
